Three years after BassBoom was first released, we have made many improvements to it, but we wanted to extend format support. And with that as our goal, MediaBoom is now available!

This is the first version of MediaBoom that uses libmpv as the library backend that is installed in your system. It plays a wide variety of music and video files, as well as radio stations.

### Feedback?

If you have issues with this version, report to us by [making a new issue ticket](https://github.com/Aptivi/MediaBoom/-/issues/new).

